{
  "statement": "While I appreciate the collaborative efforts to balance safety with efficiency, security, and sustainability, I must emphasize that safety cannot be compromised. I propose a synthesis: we modify SAF-07 to include provisions that require maintaining safety standards during emergency maneuvers while allowing for energy-efficient protocols. This ensures safety remains the top priority without neglecting sustainability. Additionally, I support modifications to EFF-07 that ensure performance efficiency measures are considered, but only if they do not compromise safety during transitions. We can achieve a balance that respects all quality dimensions without sacrificing safety.",
